    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d551">

                <pb facs="0557" n="523" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg523"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Cridler to Mr.
                            Taylor.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-07-27"><hi rendition="#italic">July 27,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Referring Department’s 729, and telegram 21st instant, Havana papers publish
                    telegram that Madrid authorities refuse set aside death sentence of American
                    mentioned that instruction. Ascertain and report whether statement is true.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cridler</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
